12T15:42:55Z"},"tree":{"sha":"00670ad5e824afe9971c516576c56b3b9b70869f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/00670ad5e824afe9971c516576c56b3b9b70869f"},"message":"types: add order-independent endpoint comparison\n\nAdd EndpointsChanged function that compares endpoint slices\nwithout regard to ordering. Uses netip.AddrPort.Compare with\nslices.SortFunc to enable accurate change detection.\n\nUpdate PeerChangeFromMapRequest to only include endpoints in\nPeerChange when they actually changed, avoiding unnecessary\nupdates to peers.","parents":[{"sha":"da9018a0ebc23d67741f3b4caf61ed00a026ead9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/da9018a0ebc23d67741f3b4caf61ed00a026ead9","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/da9018a0ebc23d67741f3b4caf61ed00a026ead9"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJwFW5qQ7uGuJbCxl3YM+QlDdc9eQb7LhX7n4Hno55uuAP6op1vhURThl5QZCbmAHb\nWgF5SnaBjRRgqCqPEeqwM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 00670ad5e824afe9971c516576c56b3b9b70869f\nparent da9018a0ebc23d67741f3b4caf61ed00a026ead9\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1762033423 +0100\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1762962175 +0100\n\ntypes: add order-independent endpoint comparison\n\nAdd EndpointsChanged function that compares endpoint slices\nwithout regard to ordering. Uses netip.AddrPort.Compare with\nslices.SortFunc to enable accurate change detection.\n\nUpdate PeerChangeFromMapRequest to only include endpoints in\nPeerChange when they actually changed, avoiding unnecessary\nupdates to peers.\n","verified_at":"2025-11-12T15:44:31Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"dcf3219bca56c1df22af8c4fbf0e99c2198c31e5","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGRjZjMyMTliY2E1NmMxZGYyMmFmOGM0ZmJmMGU5OWMyMTk4YzMxZTU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/dcf3219bca56c1df22af8c4fbf0e99c2198c31e5","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/dcf3219bca56c1df22af8c4fbf0e99c2198c31e5","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-11-01T21:44:01Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-11-12T15:42:55Z"},"tree":{"sha":"a4bb1186f4238219a9bfa3bb02ba6b2dea4f52f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/a4bb1186f4238219a9bfa3bb02ba6b2dea4f52f4"},"message":"types/change: add NodeEndpoint and NodeDERP change types\n\nAdd specific change types for endpoint and DERP region updates,\nenabling lightweight patch responses instead of full map updates.\n\nAlso fix NodeOnline/NodeOffline to accept NodeView and properly\nextract IsSubnetRouter flag, fixing a bug where subnet routers\nwould incorrectly receive patch responses instead of full maps.","parents":[{"sha":"2232d3fda9250d282210d782d443b4b1406318d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/2232d3fda9250d282210d782d443b4b1406318d9","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/2232d3fda9250d282210d782d443b4b1406318d9"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIp2JJ09l5yasAPw/6d4fMywhh4JlJhsTz+vry0BIwanzJujD8CZ3kltvB7dKD8dSe\nrpP4cqDLIeJ694cg19Kws=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree a4bb1186f4238219a9bfa3bb02ba6b2dea4f52f4\nparent 2232d3fda9250d282210d782d443b4b1406318d9\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1762033441 +0100\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1762962175 +0100\n\ntypes/change: add NodeEndpoint and NodeDERP change types\n\nAdd specific change types for endpoint and DERP region updates,\nenabling lightweight patch responses instead of full map updates.\n\nAlso fix NodeOnline/NodeOffline to accept NodeView and properly\nextract IsSubnetRouter flag, fixing a bug where subnet routers\nwould incorrectly receive patch responses instead of full maps.\n","verified_at":"2025-11-12T15:44:31Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"7b93539c12e8a67bcac0f09008756adb0ba8a1ca","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDdiOTM1MzljMTJlOGE2N2JjYWMwZjA5MDA4NzU2YWRiMGJhOGExY2E","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/7b93539c12e8a67bcac0f09008756adb0ba8a1ca","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/7b93539c12e8a67bcac0f09008756adb0ba8a1ca","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-11-01T21:45:53Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-11-12T15:42:55Z"},"tree":{"sha":"9dd96cebd5be4ef9eefb474b36d737cb8788523f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/9dd96cebd5be4ef9eefb474b36d737cb8788523f"},"message":"state: detect and return specific change types\n\nDetect when only endpoints or DERP region changed and return\nspecific change types instead of generic NodeAdded. This allows\nthe batcher to send lightweight PeerChangedPatch responses.\n\nWhen both endpoint and DERP change together, prioritize endpoint\nchange type. The batcher will include both in the patch response.\n\nAlso fix NodeOnline/NodeOffline calls to pass NodeView.","parents":[{"sha":"dcf3219bca56c1df22af8c4fbf0e99c2198c31e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/dcf3219bca56c1df22af8c4fbf0e99c2198c31e5","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/dcf3219bca56c1df22af8c4fbf0e99c2198c31e5"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNA7mb4GtlIOS6NdRBPshuyFiYxJRWx/ap1YUmyOC7Z7fwGMbRUVhuqpAqhkehSOfS\nkkBfZtuqiWeHD17rWQSw0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 9dd96cebd5be4ef9eefb474b36d737cb8788523f\nparent dcf3219bca56c1df22af8c4fbf0e99c2198c31e5\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1762033553 +0100\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1762962175 +0100\n\nstate: detect and return specific change types\n\nDetect when only endpoints or DERP region changed and return\nspecific change types instead of generic NodeAdded. This allows\nthe batcher to send lightweight PeerChangedPatch responses.\n\nWhen both endpoint and DERP change together, prioritize endpoint\nchange type. The batcher will include both in the patch response.\n\nAlso fix NodeOnline/NodeOffline calls to pass NodeView.\n","verified_at":"2025-11-12T15:44:31Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"93909f808ff85e821db202e447c56c760cc45f2f","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDkzOTA5ZjgwOGZmODVlODIxZGIyMDJlNDQ3YzU2Yzc2MGNjNDVmMmY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/93909f808ff85e821db202e447c56c760cc45f2f","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/93909f808ff85e821db202e447c56c760cc45f2f","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-11-01T21:46:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-11-12T15:42:55Z"},"tree":{"sha":"500c03c3108e7774431a53e9822838893d62e699","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/500c03c3108e7774431a53e9822838893d62e699"},"message":"mapper: handle NodeEndpoint and NodeDERP changes\n\nAdd batcher cases for NodeEndpoint and NodeDERP that query\nNodeStore for current state and send PeerChangedPatch with\nboth endpoints and DERP region, avoiding full map responses.\n\nUpdate batcher_test to pass NodeView to change constructors.","parents":[{"sha":"7b93539c12e8a67bcac0f09008756adb0ba8a1ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/comm